# Online Examination & Evaluation System

An online exam platform where admins can create exams, faculty can manage question banks, and students can attempt exams with time limits. The system features auto-evaluation for objective answers and generates result analytics.

## Technology Stack
- **Frontend**: Flutter (Dart) - For building a responsive and interactive user interface.
- **Backend**: Node.js & Express - Provides RESTful APIs and business logic.
- **Database & Services**: Firebase (Firestore Database & Firebase Authentication) - For real-time database storage and user management.

## Main Screens
- **Login & Registration**: Secure user authentication synced with Firebase.
- **Admin/Faculty Dashboard**: Central hub to manage exams and question banks.
- **Student Dashboard**: Where students can view available exams and check their past results.
- **Take Exam Screen**: The actual exam interface featuring a timer, auto-submission, and a seamless testing experience.

## Main APIs
- `POST /api/users/register`: Registers a new user in Firebase Auth and stores user details in Firestore.
- `POST /api/users/login`: Authenticates the user and returns their profile and role.
- `GET /api/exams`: Fetches the list of available exams.
- `POST /api/exams`: Creates a new exam (Admin/Faculty).
- `POST /api/exams/:id/submit`: Submits the student's exam answers for auto-evaluation.

